Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.56,1:19:33.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们不打电话我 你们不给我发邮件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't call me, you don't e-mail,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.69,1:19:35.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们不来踩我的空间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you don't comment on my Facebook page.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.90,1:19:38.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们都不告诉我 你们要来参加重聚会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys didn't even let me know you were coming back for the reunion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.36,1:19:41.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们知道 莫名奇妙的 你就把事件搞砸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because we knew, somehow, you would find a way to screw things up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.16,1:19:43.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 抱歉 吉姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'm sorry, Jim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.99,1:19:45.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想我们能玩得开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted us to have a fucking fun time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.66,1:19:47.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个周末 就像我们在高中时那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this weekend, like we did in high school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.33,1:19:49.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们不能回到过去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we're not in high school any more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.50,1:19:51.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你深深地陷在过去 硬条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are so trapped in the past, Stifler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.16,1:19:54.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么时候你才能明白 事情已经变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When are you going to realize that things will never be the way they used to be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.34,1:20:02.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.76,1:20:05.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,晚会结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guess the party's over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.85,1:20:09.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,二货们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dicks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.63,1:20:43.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 这是一个美好的晚会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that was a great party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.38,1:20:46.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得承认我玩得很开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I honestly think I had fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.72,1:20:51.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,聚会让我们有机会在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that makes one of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.77,1:20:55.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蜜雪儿骂你了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you heard from Michelle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.27,1:20:58.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有 她不跟我说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. She doesn't want to talk to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.82,1:21:00.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚的重聚会她来吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the reunion tonight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.69,1:21:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她说可能来可能不来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She said she may or may not come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.99,1:21:04.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on with you two?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.95,1:21:06.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吉姆 你还有什么想说的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jim, is there anything you want to talk about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.54,1:21:11.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.45,1:21:13.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.79,1:21:17.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一般隔多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How often{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.54,1:21:20.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你与妈妈那个...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}did you and Mom...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.05,1:21:25.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你懂的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.43,1:21:27.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你们吵架的原因?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that what this is about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.59,1:21:29.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你与蜜雪儿最近没有...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and Michelle haven't been...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.60,1:21:31.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,近来没有 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not lately, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.51,1:21:32.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.10,1:21:36.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.10,1:21:38.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阳萎了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an erectile problem?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.44,1:21:43.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有时你可以找段时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because sometimes you can buy a little time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.94,1:21:45.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用手指试一试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with a well-placed thumb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.32,1:21:47.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 我想说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God. I'm just saying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.28,1:21:49.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我觉得不是这个原因 - 不是这个原因?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't think that's it. - That's not it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.45,1:21:54.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有些东西记得一直放在口袋里 这样做没什么坏处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! That's something to keep in your back pocket, because that's a no-fail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.41,1:21:56.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好 我说得清楚一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, let's be done with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.25,1:21:59.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以前本来一切都很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, things in that department were fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.88,1:22:02.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后埃文出生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then Evan was born{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.17,1:22:06.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我们就稍稍停了停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we kind of stopped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.30,1:22:10.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后从那时起就没再做过了 清楚了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they haven't really picked up since, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.93,1:22:14.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是核心问题 别担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not a problem, so do not worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.31,1:22:16.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你明白吗?听着 吉姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You understand? Yeah, listen, Jim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.31,1:22:17.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在你生出以前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before you were born,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.85,1:22:20.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你妈妈跟我 几乎每天都做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your mother and I, we would do it every day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.90,1:22:21.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不需要这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.98,1:22:24.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有时一天两三次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes two or three times a day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.40,1:22:28.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在70年代 有很多姿势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is back in the '70s. A lot of experimentation was going on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.20,1:22:32.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你妈妈最喜欢的一招是...“海底捞月”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mother favored something she called, "diving for dollars."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.16,1:22:36.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我靠 不好意思 我不需要...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit. I'm sorry, I don't need...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.12,1:22:38.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事 我们能...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's fine, we can...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.67,1:22:39.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还是不谈这个吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have to go on with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.00,1:22:45.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是当你有了小孩 你变成了爸爸或妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But my point is, when you have a kid, you become a dad and a mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.84,1:22:50.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,并不意味着 不再是丈夫或妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's very important not to stop being a husband and a wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.64,1:22:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你继续丈夫的角色 嘿咻就会到来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you do that, the sex will come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.27,1:22:57.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听起来好像有点意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That actually makes a lot of sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.89,1:23:01.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能傻等 直到两人都有空闲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you can't just wait for the two of you to be alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.44,1:23:04.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而是 你应该创造两人都空闲的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to make your own alone time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.11,1:23:08.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你认为什么你一周去三次学校?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you think you went to Hebrew school three times a week?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.95,1:23:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,周日 12点到3点?周二 4点到7点?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sundays, noon to three? Tuesdays, four to seven?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.07,1:23:14.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好 我懂了 爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I get it, Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.45,1:23:16.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你懂了 那为什么有问题?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you get it, then why the questions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.83,1:23:17.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.00,1:23:20.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你能搞定的 抱歉 - 我会听进去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're going through this, I am sorry. - I should be listening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.25,1:23:23.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我反应过头了 抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm overreacting. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.09,1:23:28.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很感谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.34,1:23:31.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Again. Really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.68,1:23:35.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,随时都行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anytime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.77,1:23:42.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome, you guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.44,1:23:45.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 找到你们的身份标签 找出你们要坐的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, find your nametag, find out what table you're sitting at.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.07,1:23:48.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾希莉 见到你真高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ashley, so good to see you! Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.49,1:23:51.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比利!天啊 你看上去真苗条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Billy! Oh, my God, you're looking so svelte.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.70,1:23:54.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你曾经过度肥胖了 我挺担心的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You used to be morbidly obese. I was concerned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.91,1:23:56.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.08,1:23:57.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He)', guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.24,1:23:58.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 吉姆 奥兹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Jim. Oz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.20,1:24:00.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,米娅在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Mia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.46,1:24:02.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天早晨她走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She flew out this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.75,1:24:05.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 可惜啊 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. I'm sorry, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.92,1:24:06.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蜜雪儿怎么样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about Michelle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.21,1:24:10.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还不清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not sure yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.80,1:24:12.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,芬奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ALL; Finch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.30,1:24:15.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事?我一直给警局打电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened? I called the police department a thousand times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.72,1:24:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 凯文 但是我妈妈把我保释了出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I appreciate that, Kevin. But my mom, actually, bailed me out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.35,1:24:23.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们 我搞砸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, I screwed up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.02,1:24:26.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那摩托是我老板的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That bike belongs to my boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.27,1:24:30.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他答应给我加薪的 但是还是没有给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I was promised a raise, and I didn't get it, so I{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.74,1:24:31.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我先把它借出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}simply borrowed it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.78,1:24:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实是我对我老婆已经没兴趣了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The truth is that my life isn't interesting at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.78,1:24:39.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是一个副经理 工作在新泽西州贝永市一家贸易市场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am an assistant manager at a Staples in Bayonne, New Jersey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.04,1:24:43.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我骗了我最好的朋友们 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I lied to my best friends, and I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.67,1:24:47.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,芬奇 仅仅因为你忽悠我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Finch, just because you sold out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.84,1:24:50.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像我们一样只有一份无聊的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and got a boring job like most of us,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.92,1:24:52.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那并不意味着你要觉得很难堪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that doesn't mean you should be embarrassed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.63,1:24:55.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对的 伙计 没什么大不了的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, come on, man. None of that shit matters.{\r}
