Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.05,1:36:21.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听上去像模范丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that means being the sexiest husband possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.13,1:36:23.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.01,1:36:25.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蜜雪儿 你今天真漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Michelle, you look beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.72,1:36:28.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.52,1:36:30.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能与你跳个舞吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like to dance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.56,1:36:32.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很乐意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd love to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.49,1:36:49.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.25,1:36:55.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,硬条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stifler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.67,1:36:58.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雪门?雪门终结者?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sherman? The Sherminator?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.80,1:37:00.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在哪里发财呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck have you been up to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.67,1:37:03.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都结婚了 有了孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Married. Had a kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.22,1:37:04.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过现在已经离了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And divorced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.34,1:37:07.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 真可惜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.05,1:37:09.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,唉 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'm sure you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.31,1:37:12.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是 至少我有儿子小弗朗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, you know what, at least I got to keep little Furlong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.52,1:37:15.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你给你儿子取名爱德华·弗朗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You named your kid after Eddie Furlong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.02,1:37:17.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 你懂的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I did. You know why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.52,1:37:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,, 《终结者2》是有史以来最牛逼的电影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because Terminator 2 is still the greatest film ever made.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.19,1:37:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计 你需要疯狂地做爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude, you need to get banged bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.65,1:38:02.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我们要离开这了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, we have to get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.82,1:38:04.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,时间差不多了 耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's about time. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.54,1:38:10.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看上去注定要悲剧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a lost cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.83,1:38:13.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里的女人要么是已婚 要么有男伴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All these women are either married or came with dates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.00,1:38:16.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 隆妮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Loni.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.09,1:38:19.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计 喜不喜欢让你的世界更带劲啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude, how would you like to have your world blown?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.89,1:38:33.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,后会有期 硬条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hasta la vista, Stifler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.52,1:38:42.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好极了 每个人都有目标 就我没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great, everybody's getting laid but me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.36,1:38:43.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是悲了个剧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This sucks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.82,1:38:45.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打扰一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.78,1:38:47.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi. Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.83,1:38:50.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在找保罗·芬奇 你见过他吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm looking for Paul Finch. Have you seen him anywhere?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.04,1:38:52.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找芬奇有什么事吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want with Finch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.91,1:38:56.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来这接他回去 我是他妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here to pick him up. I'm his mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.55,1:39:00.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,芬奇也有妈妈?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finch has a mom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.05,1:39:06.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是 你是芬奇妈妈?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, you're Finch's mom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.89,1:39:09.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 你是他朋友?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Are you a friend of his?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.39,1:39:10.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.60,1:39:13.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,保罗是我最好的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paul is like my best friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.31,1:39:17.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在比以往任何时候都爱他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love him so much. More now than ever before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.73,1:39:21.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真不敢相信 我们以前没见过 我叫斯蒂夫勒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact, I can't believe we haven't met. I'm Steven Stifler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.03,1:39:25.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是瑞琪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Rachel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.99,1:39:29.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.20,1:39:32.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有一个预感 感觉有什么奇妙的事要发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just got this feeling like something really bad is about to happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.12,1:39:38.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心!我会像教堂里的老鼠一样平静的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry. I'll be as quiet as a church mouse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.59,1:39:43.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 吉姆!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Jim!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.04,1:39:49.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.18,1:39:52.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我好想要你哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you so bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.26,1:39:53.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 你说到点子上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you have no idea!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.09,1:39:56.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 天啊 哦 天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God! Oh, God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.98,1:40:00.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 天啊 这真是屌爆了 我再也忍不住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God, there it is. I don't think I can hold it any more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.61,1:40:01.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.69,1:40:03.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.86,1:40:05.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知这有多给力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just forgot how awesome this is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.15,1:40:07.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 耶 我要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah, I need this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.12,1:40:12.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 哦 天啊 蜜雪儿! - 妈的 我爱你!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, God, Michelle! - Fuck, I love you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.87,1:40:14.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吉姆?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jim?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.21,1:40:17.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,娜迪娅?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nadia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.42,1:40:20.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.46,1:40:24.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 你很忙是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. You are busy, yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.46,1:40:26.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不忙...很忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.63,1:40:27.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是 是 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, yeah, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.47,1:40:31.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,娜迪娅 见到你真高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nadia, it's so nice to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.85,1:40:34.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能等我一分钟吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But do you think you could give us a minute?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.68,1:40:35.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.72,1:40:36.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三分钟好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.89,1:40:40.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩还在一起 真不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay! So nice you are still together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.69,1:40:44.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你比以前过得更好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I see you've gotten much better at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.78,1:40:47.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.91,1:40:54.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是吉姆?一点也不比我强嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Jim? He looks nothing like me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.29,1:41:01.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当我在高中时 我与一个曲棍球队员约会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, when I was in high school, I dated a lacrosse player.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.67,1:41:03.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上 我跟他们很多人约会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact, I dated a few of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.71,1:41:05.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不必说这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.88,1:41:09.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直希望保罗能练练体育\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always wanted Paul to be more into sports.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.22,1:41:11.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是他一点儿都不感兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he was never that interested.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.43,1:41:14.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不必替他掩饰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to sugarcoat it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.26,1:41:15.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,芬奇是个二货\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finch was a klutz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.10,1:41:21.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,耶 可能是吧 他没从我这学到什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I guess he was, but he did not get that from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.23,1:41:24.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是拉拉队队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was head cheerleader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.44,1:41:27.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果说我从曲棍球队学到点什么的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if there's anything I learned from lacrosse players,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.93,1:41:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就是 我喜欢用棍子...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's that I like to handle a stick{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.82,1:41:35.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大力击球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and cradle those balls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.62,1:41:39.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱死你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.79,1:41:43.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了吗?硬条?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you ready for me, Stifler?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.55,1:41:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.38,1:41:51.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.13,1:41:54.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 蜜雪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Michelle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.22,1:41:56.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 天啊 蜜雪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God, Michelle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.72,1:41:59.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你太令人吃惊了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are amazing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.52,1:42:00.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比浴缸好?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better than the bathtub?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.06,1:42:02.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好更多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.90,1:42:05.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比这个好?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better than this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.98,1:42:07.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.40,1:42:11.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.41,1:42:15.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 脱掉衣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, take those off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.49,1:42:16.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We shouldn't be doing this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.95,1:42:18.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我们就要这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, we should.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.12,1:42:19.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 硬条君\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Stifler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.12,1:42:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 芬奇妈咪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Finch's mom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.17,1:42:24.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叫我威猛硬条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call me the Stifmeister!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.67,1:42:27.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,耶 你是威猛硬条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you are the Stifmeister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.91,1:42:30.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,痰伯母?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}MILF?{\r}
